<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci lowered.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Research said on Tuesday it lowered Mexican retail chain Controladora Comercial Mexicana (Comerci) to market performer from a buy.</p>
<p>Analyst Esteban Galindez said the debt-financed purchase of Kmart Mexico SA and the end of the Auchan joint venture will not lead to a significant revision in earnings estimates, but will negatively affect investor perception of the company.</p>
<p>Comerci's benchmark UBC shares on the Mexican bourse were up four centavos to 6.58 pesos in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
